</figure>


</div>

<h3 id="-人像">人像<a class="h-anchor" href="#-%e4%ba%ba%e5%83%8f" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h3>
<div class="gallery-row cols-2">

<figure class="figure"><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202307/midjourney-runway-gen2-animation/images/midjourney-runway-gen2-animation-16.webp" width="1090" height="603" alt="人像（圖 16）" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
</figure>

<figure class="figure figure-video">
  <video class="gifv" muted loop playsinline controls preload="none" poster="https://deanlin.net/blog/202307/midjourney-runway-gen2-animation/images/midjourney-runway-gen2-animation-17.webp" width="896" height="512" aria-label="a young male person with silver hair standing on the beach, in the style of sandara tang, piratepunk, karol bak, video, white and amber, hiroshi nagai, enchanting — ar 128:71" data-gifv>
    <source src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202307/midjourney-runway-gen2-animation/images/midjourney-runway-gen2-animation-17.mp4" type="video/mp4">
  </video>
  <figcaption>a young male person with silver hair standing on the beach, in the style of sandara tang, piratepunk, karol bak, video, white and amber, hiroshi nagai, enchanting — ar 128:71</figcaption>
</figure>


</div>

<h2 id="結語">結語<a class="h-anchor" href="#%e7%b5%90%e8%aa%9e" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h2>
<p>嘗試各種素材後，我發現了以下規則：</p>
<ul>
<li>圖片不要有太多元素，當細節太多時，哪塊會成為動畫完全憑運氣。</li>
<li>人物盡量只挑上半身，不然產出的影片會很獵奇。</li>
<li>多種素材測試下來，場景的表現是最好的。</li>
</ul>
<p>下面分享一些悲劇的案例：</p>
<div class="gallery-row cols-2">

<figure class="figure"><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202307/midjourney-runway-gen2-animation/images/midjourney-runway-gen2-animation-18.webp" width="1400" height="785" alt="結語（圖 18）" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
</figure>

<figure class="figure figure-video">
  <video class="gifv" muted loop playsinline controls preload="none" poster="https://deanlin.net/blog/202307/midjourney-runway-gen2-animation/images/midjourney-runway-gen2-animation-19.webp" width="896" height="512" aria-label="在雲端拉小提琴結果摔下去" data-gifv>
    <source src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202307/midjourney-runway-gen2-animation/images/midjourney-runway-gen2-animation-19.mp4" type="video/mp4">
  </video>
  <figcaption>在雲端拉小提琴結果摔下去</figcaption>
</figure>


</div>

<div class="gallery-row cols-2">

<figure class="figure"><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202307/midjourney-runway-gen2-animation/images/midjourney-runway-gen2-animation-20.webp" width="1400" height="785" alt="結語（圖 20）" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
</figure>

<figure class="figure figure-video">
  <video class="gifv" muted loop playsinline controls preload="none" poster="https://deanlin.net/blog/202307/midjourney-runway-gen2-animation/images/midjourney-runway-gen2-animation-21.webp" width="896" height="512" aria-label="原本希望在沙漠前行，結果變成了鬼步" data-gifv>
    <source src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202307/midjourney-runway-gen2-animation/images/midjourney-runway-gen2-animation-21.mp4" type="video/mp4">
  </video>
  <figcaption>原本希望在沙漠前行，結果變成了鬼步</figcaption>
</figure>


</div>

<p>雖然部分結果不如預期，但這些成果也足夠驚人了；從筆者的角度來看，AI 將對影視產業產生巨大的衝擊，就像綠幕剛誕生的時候一樣。</p>
<a class="linkcard" href="https://dean-lin.medium.com/list/ddcc9c53a4ac" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
